====Usage notes====
* {{s|Earth}} Often used with a definite article ''[[jörðin|jörð'''in''']]'', a little akin to the English "'''the''' earth".
* The archaic declensions '''jörðu''' (indef. acc. and dat. sg.), '''jörðunni''' (def. dat. sg.) are sometimes used. Compare [[sól]], [[mörk]] and [[nótt]].

